+registration must itself pass the unchanged required gate; no expected-success
+check, empty evidence branch, self-authored approval, protection disabling or
+legacy #228 reuse can stand in for that execution. Independently review this
+limitation explicitly rather than mark the overall release ready.
+
+## Acceptance and exclusions
+
+Acceptance requires exact measured signed native bytes, frozen canonical fixture,
+negative tamper/path/version/signature tests, the unchanged guarded model
+protocol, independently reviewed base-first listing registration, and actual
+complete protected gate success. Capacity cleanup/expansion, production writes,
+backfill publication, app deployment and strategy promotion are excluded now.
